# The repo root .gitignore ignores `next-env.d.ts` repo-wide (with a
# carve-out for templates/*/next-env.d.ts), so this template's tracked
# next-env.d.ts stays tracked. `.next` (the Next build cache) stays
# ignored here, matching every other template in the repo.

